<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Updated Target List</title>
<style  type='text/css'>
    table{
            text-align:center;
            margin-left:auto;
            margin-right:auto;
            border-style:solid;
            border-spacing:8px;
            border-width:2px;
            border-collapse:separate
        }
    a:link {color:blue;}
    a:visited {color:teal;}
</style>
</head>

<body style='color:#000000;background-color:#FFFFE0'>

<h1>Updated Targets List</h1>
<p>This list contains all targets which have been verified as updated.</p>
<ul>
    <li>Please select a verified month to see the list of targets.</li>
    <li style='padding-top:6px'>If you want to see the most recent data list, 
        plese reload this page<br /> 
        before open a list of targets. The update may take several seconds.</li>
</ul>

<table border=1>
<!--First row is all of the years-->
<tr><th>Year</th>
{% for year in range(2005, curr_year + 1) %}
    <th>{{ year }}</th>
{% endfor%}
</tr>

{% for month in range(1,13) %}
    <tr><th>{{ month_abbr[month] }}</th>
    {% for year in range(2005, curr_year + 1) %}
        {% if year == curr_year and month > curr_month %}
            <td>&#160;</td>
        {% else %}
            <td><a href="./{{ archive_subdir_name }}/{{ month_abbr[month] }}_{{ year }}.html">{{ month_abbr[month] }}</a></td>
        {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    </tr>
{% endfor %}

</table>

<p style='padding-top:30px'> <strong>Back to:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="https://cxc.cfa.harvard.edu/cgi-bin/target_search/search.html">
        <strong>Chandra Uplink Support Observation Search Form</strong></a>
    </li>
    <li><a href="https://cxc.cfa.harvard.edu/wsgi/cus/usint/">
        <strong>Chandra Uplink Support Organizational Page</strong></a>
    </li>
</ul>
</p>
<hr />
<p style='padding-top:10px'>
<em>
If you have any questions about this page, please contact 
<a href='mailto:bwargelin@head.cfa.harvard.edu'>bwargelin@head.cfa.harvard.edu</a>.
</em>
</p>

</body>
</html>